prices_stromligning.description:
Sensors of the Strømligning integration. The buy price is required; the sell sensors give an exact sell price for solar.

Strømligning switches its excl. VAT sensors off by default, and a disabled sensor can't be selected here: enable them first under **Settings → Devices & services → Entities** (*Show disabled entities*). The price forecasts also need *Include price forecasts for the next week?* in the Strømligning options.
Disabled in Strømligning now: {stromligning_disabled}

prices_stromligning_tariffs.description:
When selling, the tariffs and taxes in the price are subtracted, followed by the sell fee and the net and system tariff. Leave a field empty to use 0.

The tariff sensors may be disabled in Strømligning, and then they can't be selected here: enable them first under **Settings → Devices & services → Entities** (*Show disabled entities*).
Disabled in Strømligning now: {stromligning_disabled}

import_legacy.description:
Cable Juice Planner PyScript installations found in the config folder:
{files}

Choose which one to import from (it may have another prefix than **{prefix}**). The settings are used as defaults on the next pages, the databases (charging history, drive efficiency, consumption, prices, solar) are copied at the first start, and the values of the old input_* helpers are copied to the new entities. The PyScript files are only read, never changed.

